<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάπλ-ωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfolding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτύλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὑμένων εἰς πλάτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.8
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίλησις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.385
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>opening out,</i> of roots, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>explanation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Erot.
				<u>Prooem.</u>
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>expansion</i> or <i>paraphrase</i> of an expression, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> Math.,
				<i>expansion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς μονάδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Ar.</u>
					2.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
